WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:07.000
It possesses enormous power,
and brings endless pleasure

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:10.960
and destruction  to those who are destined.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.720
The Witchblade.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.800
At this moment, one woman has awakened.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.460
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.050
I shout out countless times, break out

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:42.240
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.530
Hot blood flows through my body

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:51.240
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:57.840
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:03.340
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.880
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.390
Uncontrollable impulses

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:19.310
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:26.530
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:33.530
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.710
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:43.280
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:52.900
"Past"

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:58.780
Shiori!

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:02.030
Doctor, I...

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.040
Put away your Blade!

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:15.880
No! I didn't ! Doctor!

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:20.590
What's happening?! I can't believe this!

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:25.930
Calm down, Shiori. Your body
is just going through a change.

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.390
Change?

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:31.150
Don't worry. I'll take care of you.

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:33.810
You will?

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:39.280
Please understand, Doctor...

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:48.080
I never intended for this to happen.
I just thought... it might feel good.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.290
I see... is that how it was?

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:58.340
Then... we'll discuss
this later... at our leisure.

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:03.050
It felt so... good.

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:17.480
Shiori...

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:23.860
I'm looking for this cruiser.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:28.830
Recognize it?

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:30.330
Nope...

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:36.000
H-Hey! Got a minute? This cruiser...

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:47.470
I see cruisers like this at sea,
but I wouldn't remember exactly where,

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:50.470
and I sure wouldn't know where it's docked...

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:53.020
Any piece of information will do.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:58.520
Well, a boat this size can really go far.

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:01.280
So it might not be docked in Tokyo.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:05.160
Could be in Yokohama or
Chiba... maybe even farther.

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:08.120
Probably be tough to find it...

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.500
I see. Thanks.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.590
Searching on my own sounds pretty rough...

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.180
Enter.

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:37.310
What's the meaning of this?!

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:40.650
Cripes! Acting like she's
an enemy or something!

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:47.910
Are you two out to fool me?!
That's Lady with you, isn't it?!

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:57.210
Explain it clearly!
Otherwise, I can't work properly!

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.670
All right.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:05.130
Remember when I told you that
Douji and the NSWF cooperated

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:08.760
to conduct Witchblade research?

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:09.890
Yes.

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:16.180
At that time, the NSWF dispatched
a woman to help us; it was Lady.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:24.990
I was sent by NSWF to assist
in the Witchblade research.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:26.900
I'm Sohou Reina.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:29.660
I'm Takayama. Nice to meet you.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:35.660
She was an outstanding woman.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:40.130
Intelligent, refined, physically fit
and beautiful. Everything about her.

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:46.970
I was amazed that the NSWF's
Neo-Genes could be like this.

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:53.010
So it's like that, is it?

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:58.770
It's like a cheap drama show.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:06.110
Don't put it like that. I didn't think
you were the type to fall in love.

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:09.150
I wouldn't call it love.
Eh?

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:13.580
What do you mean?

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:17.660
She disappeared without a trace.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.790
Disappeared?!

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:24.840
As our research reached its climax,
Reina took the Witchblade and ran off.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:26.000
Eh?!

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:32.760
The Witchblade's been stolen!
It was probably Dr. Sohou!

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:38.520
At first, I thought it was on NSWF orders.

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:43.060
But Reina had disappeared
completely with the Witchblade.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.980
Why?

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:48.070
She could be very egotistical.

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:51.700
She probably wanted
the Witchblade all to herself.

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:55.740
I heard that the Witchblade
chooses its wielder.

00:06:55.830 --> 00:07:01.080
Yes, Reina was also compatible with Witchblade.

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:03.630
She was?!

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:06.550
We discovered it during our research.

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:11.260
However, we couldn't let
someone from the NSWF wear it.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:15.510
Some staff members favored
dropping Reina from the research.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:21.850
But just before that, both she
and the Witchblade disappeared.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:27.320
So she betrayed you?

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:30.650
Whether she harbored
such thoughts is troublesome.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.950
So that's the past you shared.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:36.200
Father keeps his Neo-Genes well-protected.

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:41.290
Reina was simply curious about
her discovery of men and women.

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:44.620
But what about you?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.000
It's all in the past.

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:54.470
Increased stimulation
in the brain's limbic lobe,

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:57.260
particularly in the cortical column.

00:07:57.350 --> 00:08:00.850
Why does this synchronize
with the Blade's activation?

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:06.100
It stimulates the wearer's instincts,
and guides her to fight further.

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:09.270
Does this make the subject spellbound?

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:12.690
Or perhaps...

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:17.950
No! I can't wear this!

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:22.790
Naomi-bou! Don't be so
embarrassed! It's cutesy!

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:26.250
Naomi-Chan! It really looks cute!

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:31.670
This... This will only attract bad luck!

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:40.600
She's really shy, so a noticeable
outfit'll only have the opposite effect.

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:43.230
It's your fault for laughing at her.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.680
Oh, really?

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:48.230
Oh, here you are, Chou-san!

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:51.530
No use asking for money. Got none.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:58.110
It's not like that! Remember
that massage... with the girls...

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:02.620
What?! Why didn't you
say so sooner, Tozawa-Chan?!

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.040
OK, Chou-san?

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:05.710
OK!

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:13.090
Now we're talking!
Come over here, young 'un! To my office!

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:16.220
I sense it...

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:19.930
I sense it... a bad aura...

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.810
Now I see...

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:26.770
Hey, boy!

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:29.770
Give it here. Over here.

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:35.610
So? What do you want to check?

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:38.910
Well, the owner. And where it's docked.

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:40.820
I see...

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:45.910
Say, Tozawa-Chan... You really
gonna set me up with a group date?

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:49.750
Of course I will, no problem!

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:51.000
Sounds sweet!

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:55.300
A group date?

00:09:55.380 --> 00:10:01.680
All right! Let's try accessing
our network worldwide...

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:04.560
Okay, check, check, 1 , 2...

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.680
Hello!
Hey, Chou-san! What's up?

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:09.730
Yo, l33t d00d! What's the
word on the netz0r? I got

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:13.770
Whoa... Chou-san is amazing...

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.730
So nerdy...

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:25.870
There's no mistake.
It's trying to destroy all of Shiori...

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:37.630
Shiori is just like an X-Con now.
She seeks even more pleasure...

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:41.010
In which case, it won't be long before...

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:49.890
More research is necessary
regarding this issue.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:56.190
In order to obtain more data,
it is urgent that we secure Shiori.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.230
End report.

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:33.560
I want someone to fulfill me...

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:39.030
She could fulfill me...

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:02.260
Kahlúa and milk. It's the
one cocktail I can make.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:08.760
It's sweet.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:13.640
Maybe it's not a drink for you.

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:14.980
What're you doing?

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:19.610
There's one open space right here.

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:22.690
I don't like it when there's just one.

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:30.290
Say. You said that Lady
took off with the Witchblade.

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:32.910
So why do I have it now?

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.080
I don't know why.

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:40.670
But there's no mistake it wound up
on you during the Great Quake.

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:46.550
On that day, we had
located Reina's whereabouts

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:51.100
and sent I-Weapons to take back the Witchblade.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:55.770
However, the NSWF had
the same idea and sent Sisters.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:58.440
I had wanted to avoid trouble in public,

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:03.070
but our mutual aggression resulted
in the worst possible scenario.

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:21.750
The dormant Witchblade awoke,
and triggered the Great Earthquake.

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:27.800
And I just happened to be there...

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:29.590
That's how it seems.

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:35.310
So it was fate?

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:40.100
But wait, why didn't Reina put
the Witchblade on? If she had

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:42.440
Who knows.

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:47.610
In any event, Reina returned to
the NSWF and donned a Cloneblade.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:51.280
Father wasn't upset with her?

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:54.660
Very few are compatible with the Witchblade.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:57.500
He wouldn't let her go so easily.

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:00.750
This isn't anything to be grateful for!

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:03.670
But its enormous power can control people.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.840
Men always rationalize like that!

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:10.180
You probably can't understand.

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:15.770
How frightening having this is...

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:29.200
Sir. We'll reach the
marina in about 30 minutes.

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:31.110
All right.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:33.700
We can finally go home.

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:36.660
I'll say... it's been so long.

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:46.710
Chou-san's amazing! He found it in ten minutes!

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:51.890
Ashina Marina, huh?

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:56.140
Alright! Once I know who owns the cruiser...

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:58.520
What'll happen?

00:14:58.600 --> 00:14:59.770
What're you doing here?!

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:02.650
Tozawa-Chan! You're going
after my mom, aren't you?!

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:04.360
"Tozawa-Chan"?!

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:06.610
Nobody's goin' after Masamune.

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:08.780
I'm keeping an eye on you, to make sure!

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:13.950
Hey, get out!
Nope! I will not!

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:18.240
Hey, c'mon... I'm in a hurry here!

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:21.790
Just so you know,
my mom doesn't like your type!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.670
Whoa, kid! You're badly mistaken!

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:27.340
Let's go see my mom already!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.840
Ugh, suit yourself!

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:39.810
It's near. But this feeling...
it's different from before.

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:42.690
I must hurry.

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:55.660
Tell me, where is she? Bring her here.

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:57.660
You mean me?

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:01.790
There you are...

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:08.590
I need more... Please...

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:15.300
This is bad, sir!
Masane-san hasn't completely recovered

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:17.350
Help her!
Right!

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:24.270
This is it...

00:16:55.340 --> 00:17:00.680
Takayama... Reiji... The doctor's...

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.730
You're dealing with me!

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:19.410
I don't sense anything from you anymore.
What a disappointment...

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:38.180
Sir!

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:45.730
You're not going anywhere...

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:51.810
Please... I beg you...

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:24.680
Is that ?

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.480
Yeah...

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:43.530
It seems Shiori, my secretary, came to see you.

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:44.990
Yes.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:49.540
Sir, what will we do with the Cloneblade?

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:52.420
That's Shiori's...

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:55.800
So that is what happened.

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:57.630
I'd like to look at her.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:00.970
There's no body.
That's impossible!

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:06.260
This is it. She crystallized and disintegrated.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:09.560
May I take that with me?

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:16.070
Take it and leave.
There's nothing else to hand over to you.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:19.360
Shiori was my secretary!
So?

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:28.240
All right.

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:29.700
Mom!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:34.670
Riko! What are you doing here?!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:39.670
Are you surprised? I came with Tozawa-Chan!

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:40.880
Tozawa?

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:44.930
Yo!

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:47.510
What's the deal?

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:51.140
He the owner of that boat?
Introduce me, will you?

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:57.860
I saw what happened under the overpass.

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:06.620
All right. But for today,
just give us a ride home.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:09.870
Oh well, guess it can't be helped. Come on.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:12.910
Is that child...

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:19.880
Reiji... Shiori died because of the Cloneblade.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:22.340
I figured as much.

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:25.800
I may end up like her in time...

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:30.180
But that applies to the Witchblade, too.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:35.350
After all, the Cloneblades
are copies of the Witchblade.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:40.940
Do you remember what we found
in that ancient data we studied?

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:47.660
The Witchblade's immense
power can destroy its wielder.

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:50.240
But there was no way to verify that.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:56.080
We did just now.
The Witchblade destroys its wielders.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:04.840
And the Witchblade will only
come off when its wearer is dead.

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:11.970
I wonder which will fall apart first...

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:15.730
In any case, I'm going to lay low for awhile.

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:07.280
I murmur, "I love you," with all my emotion

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.620
All my feelings until yesterday now overflow and dissolve quickly

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:28.550
If only this one last prayer could make it through...

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:37.390
Thank you for giving us the words to ascertain each other, God

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:49.400
Tomorrow, we'll reach out and hold hands harder than normal

00:22:49.490 --> 00:23:02.420
Tomorrow, we'll reach out, hug, kiss, and love each other

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:14.800
Just like you said, Riko,

00:23:14.890 --> 00:23:17.810
Tozawa seems to be after me.

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:20.770
Although in a different sense.

00:23:20.850 --> 00:23:23.900
Anyway, he's the worst!

00:23:23.980 --> 00:23:27.270
Selling photos I don't want made public!

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:29.820
I never wanna be friends with him!

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:32.820
But according to Mariko-san,

00:23:32.910 --> 00:23:35.950
he used to be a good photographer.

00:23:36.030 --> 00:23:40.080
I wonder. It is hard to believe, huh?
